   "Line 25 duplicates the full mongodb:// URI with credentials from mongo_test.clj:32 and connects to database 'openplanner' (line 34). The AC 'runs the suite without touching non-Epiphany databases' is met in intent — per-law UUID-prefixed collections (line 35-37) and clean-test-db! drops only the connection's own prefixed collections (mongo.clj:210-227) — but the database itself is not Epiphany-named, and AGENTS.md says 'never hardcode, never commit credentials'. This is a pre-existing pattern established by mongo_test.clj, so it does not gate promotion, but the credential now lives in two files instead of one.",
